WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
1. Connected development store and saved catalogue context
Actual ChatGPT response reports the connected store, scan completion and observed history coverage.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
2. Observed sample stock and default-policy eligibility
The saved scan reports known and unknown costs; these new products fail the default age policy.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
3. Explicit day-zero preview with known-cost guardrails
Two variants preview at $100 to $95 and $40 to $38. Previewing does not apply these prices.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
4. Precise exclusions remain visible in the preview
Unknown cost and zero stock are excluded: unknown_cost and out_of_stock.

5
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
5. Review continues inside the authenticated Shopify app
The merchant reviews the store, prices, scope, schedule and policy before confirming.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
6. Campaign confirmation requires explicit merchant approval
The unchecked approval box leaves Confirm and schedule campaign disabled. ChatGPT cannot confirm it.

7
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:02.000
7. Mixed 90% margin selection shows the exact safe exclusion
The $20-cost variant is excluded with price_floor_unavailable; the low-cost variant remains eligible.

8
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:10.000
8. Separate bounded lifecycle test for one unpublished fixture
The reviewed fixture uses preserved compare-at prices, no campaign tags, no collection and no Flow delivery.

9
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
9. Confirmation schedules the reviewed fixture campaign
Actual success state after the merchant's explicit checkbox and confirmation in Shopify.

10
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.000
10. Manual campaign processing on the development fixture
The scoped manual Process step made this campaign active; separate API readback verified the $95 price.

11
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:33.000
11. Manual End and restore returns the fixture to its original price
This lifecycle test used an explicit early restore. It does not establish unattended maintenance execution.

12
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:43.000
12. Results preserve the sales coverage limitation
Sales coverage remains not_collected; unavailable values stay visible rather than being inferred.

13
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:55.000
13. Verified manual lifecycle with explicit remaining limits
Schedule bounds are not execution timestamps. Manual apply and restore do not prove unattended execution.
